		{
			dependencies: ["648B791DCE9470AF"]
			description: ["&rThe Caramel Cube is a rare hostile mob found in the Candy Cavity, functioning as a stronger, oozing variant of the standard slime. This monster relentlessly hops after adventurers. Upon taking any damage, it leaks puddles of melted caramel that stick to the ground, slowing down players and mobs that step in them for two seconds. The cubes come in three sizes and split into smaller cubes when slain. You must keep your distance and avoid these sticky puddles, as they can quickly immobilize even a strong target."]
